OL,3,AChrista Pike's lawyers to appear in
OL,4,Acourt after failed execution of US
OL,5,Adeath row inmate
OL,6,
OL,7,FLawyers for US death row inmate Christa
OL,8,FPike are in court today asking a judge
OL,9,Fto order Tennessee to preserve all
OL,10,Fevidence from her botched execution
OL,11,Flast week
OL,13,FThe emergency motion filed by her legal
OL,14,Fteam could lay the groundwork for a
OL,15,Ffuture lawsuit against the state over
OL,16,Fhow the failed execution was carried
OL,17,Fout
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
